# Large capture policy: pcaps are welcome if < 10 MB and sanitized;
# ignore raw scratch dumps.
# "Sanitized" means Wormhole-only (VID 0711:2211, e.g. bus 3 dev 15):
# filter raw usbmon dumps before adding, e.g.
#   tshark -r <raw>.pcap -Y "usb.bus_id==3 && usb.device_address==15" -F pcap -w captures/<name>.pcap
# Only files matching the allowlist below are tracked; anything else
# (raw usbmon dumps, *_raw.pcap, oversize dumps) is ignored by default.
# See docs/issue-17-sanitise-history.md.
captures/*.pcap
!captures/wormhole_*.pcap
!captures/*.txt

